pipenv shell

With poetry:
pip install poetry
poetry install


These tools handle environments more cleanly.

🟦 Extra: If your WSL keeps breaking after PC crash

This happens a lot. To reduce problems:

✔ Don’t store projects inside:
/mnt/c/Users/...


This causes corruption when Windows crashes.

✔ Instead store projects in:
~/projects/

